# Generated by `pnpm --filter @learnstack/sdk generate` from the backend's
# OpenAPI document. Prettier reformats it (4-space to 2-space), which makes the
# file differ from what the generator writes — so every regeneration dirties the
# tree and the freshness check Standards 07 describes could never be green.
# The generator's output is the artefact; leaving it byte-for-byte is what makes
# `generate && git diff --exit-code` a meaningful gate.
packages/sdk/src/generated/

# A lockfile is a generated artefact and prettier is not its author. Left to
# itself it rewrites every `resolution: {...}` onto four lines and adds trailing
# commas — measured, 3761 lines of pure churn with all 596 integrity hashes
# unchanged. That noise buries a real dependency change in any future review.
